              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaan Yooyaadaa ilma Eliyaashiib lubicha ol aanaa sanaa keessaa tokko dhirsa intala Sanbalaax namicha Hooroon ture. Anis of biraa isa nan ariʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
